			"Message": "docs(Echo): Expand CHANGELOG with comprehensive version history\n\nReplace the sparse version history (0.0.1 through 0.6.0) with a complete changelog documenting all releases from v0.1 (Q3 2024) through v2.0 (Q1 2026). The expanded changelog captures the full evolution of the Echo task scheduler: the initial Sequence-based architecture, the pivotal June 2025 flip to the work-stealing Scheduler design, Cloudflare Workers integration, PascalCase enforcement, and the current stable v2.0 architecture.\n\nAdheres to Keep a Changelog format with clear Added/Changed/Removed sections for each release.",
