			"Message": "docs(Echo): Expand CHANGELOG with comprehensive version history\n\nReplace the minimal placeholder CHANGELOG (only \"Initial version\") with a complete version history documenting releases from 0.6.0 (2026 Q2) back to 0.0.1 (2024 Q3).\n\nThe changelog now captures all notable changes including work-stealing scheduler optimizations, Cloudflare Workers integration updates, dependency upgrades, CI improvements, and licensing changes.\n\nThis provides better visibility into the Echo element's evolution and adheres to Keep a Changelog format.",
